; query_shim_differential.journal — independent fixture for compat-differential-tester's
; Stage C Phase 8 (Query-shim convergence) verification dispatch.
; Built fresh for this dispatch; not reused from any prior implementing-session fixture.
; Covers: account/not_account/payee/date-range filtering (Query vs -q parity),
; a multi-account OR case (two distinct expense subaccounts for the deprecated
; accounts=[...] shim), and a transaction dated exactly datetime.date.max
; (9999-12-31) for the date_to overflow edge case.

